      "writtenOn": "2022-10-04T07:49:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, the plan is that Payload Config Path will be unavailable to priv apps; it\u0027ll be @TestApi but not @SystemApi, and protected by a different permission.\n\nSo I wasn\u0027t sure whether the documentation for payload binary path should mention it.\n\nBut maybe I should just go for it.",
