      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-04T12:13:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, I see. Let\u0027s discuss it in the @SystemApi change then? It feels weird to expose to developers a @Nullable method which is effectively a @NonNull, but I need to think a little bit more before formulating any opinion :)",
